<section aria-labelledby="intelligence-title" class="bg-background" id="intelligence"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28"><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10"><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 lg:col-span-7" style="transition-delay:0ms"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember-deep">Intelligence</p><h2 class="mt-5 font-heading text-[clamp(2.6rem,5.4vw,5rem)] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.02em]" id="intelligence-title">Knows your home. <em class="italic text-ember-deep">Asks when it doesn't.</em></h2></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 flex items-end lg:col-span-5" style="transition-delay:150ms"><p class="max-w-md text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Oriel remembers where things live and plans each job before it moves. When something is unclear, it checks with you first. Try a request.</p></div></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0 mt-12 md:mt-16" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div class="grid gap-3 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:col-span-4"><p class="px-1 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground" id="planner-label">Say to Oriel</p><div aria-labelledby="planner-label" class="flex flex-col gap-2" role="group"><button aria-pressed="true" class="group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-2xl border px-5 py-4 text-left text-[15px] transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring border-foreground bg-foreground text-background" type="button"><span