] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ember">The plan</p><ol class="mt-4 flex flex-col"><li class="relative flex animate-rise gap-4 pb-4 last:pb-0" style="animation-delay:300ms"><span class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><span class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-foreground/80">1</span><span class="mt-1 w-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></span><span class="pt-0.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground/85">Walks to the living room</span></li><li class="relative flex animate-rise gap-4 pb-4 last:pb-0" style="animation-delay:460ms"><span class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><span class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-foreground/80">2</span><span class="mt-1 w-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></span><span class="pt-0.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground/85">Picks the glasses up by the frame, never the lenses</span></li><li class="relative flex animate-rise gap-4 pb-4 last:pb-0" style="animation-delay:620ms"><span class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><span class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-foreground/80">3</span><span class="mt-1 w-px flex-1 bg-white/15"></span></span><span class="pt-0.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground/85">Carries them through to the kitchen</span></li><li class="relative flex animate-rise gap-4 pb-4 last:pb-0" style="animation-delay:780ms"><span class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><span class="flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 font-mono text-[11px] text-ink-foreground/80">4</span></span><span class="pt-0.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-ink-foreground/85">Hands them over at chest height, and waits</span></li></ol></div></div><div class="mt-8 flex animate-rise items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-ember/30 bg-ember/10 p-5" style="