oke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Opens doors, takes stairs, docks itself to charge</li></ul></div></div><div class="transition-[opacity,translate] duration-[900ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] motion-reduce:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none translate-y-6 opacity-0" style="transition-delay:120ms"><div class="flex h-full flex-col rounded-[2rem] bg-sand p-7 md:p-10"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">What it doesn't do yet</p><ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-foreground/10"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Cooking at the hob or oven</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Using knives or other sharp tools</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Lifting, bathing or dressing a person</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Climbing ladders or working at height</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Looking after children or pets on its own</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-3.5 text-[15px] leading-snug text-foreground/80"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-minus mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg>Leaving the house</li></ul><p class="mt-auto pt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">New skills arrive through monthly updates. We tell you what changed, and nothing new switches on without your say.</p></div></div></div></div></section>